 "remarks": "Exceptional new construction, 9 Berkeley Road presents a sophisticated interpretation of modern Westport living, blending timeless architecture with beautifully considered spaces and an exceptional floor plan. Gracious proportions, abundant natural light and 9-foot ceilings create an immediate sense of understated luxury throughout the main level. At the heart of the home, an expansive chef's kitchen with separate scullery and breakfast area opens seamlessly to a stunning family room accented by oak ceiling beams. Formal living and dining rooms provide elegant settings for entertaining, while a private home office offers a quiet retreat. A beautifully designed first-floor guest suite with full bath and walk-in closet provides privacy and flexibility for family and guests. Expansive doors extend the living spaces outdoors to a generous rear deck, complemented by a bluestone-covered porch for effortless indoor-outdoor entertaining. Upstairs, the luxurious primary suite is a private sanctuary featuring a spacious bedroom, dressing area, walk-in closet and beautifully proportioned bath. Three additional bedrooms, multiple baths, generous closets, a dedicated laundry room and loft complete the second level. Sophisticated yet inviting, and an exceptional opportunity to own a thoughtfully designed new residence where elevated style, modern luxury and effortless livability come together in one of Westport's most desirable settings. *REPRESENTAIVE IMAGES* Agent/owner",
